{"4948410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Zombie Apocalypse", "steam_appid": 4948410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to MY ZOMBIE APOCALYPSE — your city, your mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top-down action game: a low-poly city crawling with zombies, survivors, cars, guns... all wrapped in a laid-back, arcade sandbox. On foot or behind the wheel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take on dynamic missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city throws contracts at you nonstop, never in the same order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Driving is half the fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car is a weapon in its own right: plow through the horde, send lampposts flying and turn the streets into pure carnage. Every mission you clear patches you up and lines your pockets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow your cash at the shop: pistol, SMG, shotgun... and trick out your ride. The more you grind, the harder you hit — and the more you run the place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Come back for more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short missions generated on a loop, instant action: the perfect game to boot up for five minutes or two hours. Climb the global leaderboard and prove who lasts longest in this crazy town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the wheel. The city is yours.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to MY ZOMBIE APOCALYPSE — your city, your mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top-down action game: a low-poly city crawling with zombies, survivors, cars, guns... all wrapped in a laid-back, arcade sandbox. On foot or behind the wheel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take on dynamic missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city throws contracts at you nonstop, never in the same order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Driving is half the fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car is a weapon in its own right: plow through the horde, send lampposts flying and turn the streets into pure carnage. Every mission you clear patches you up and lines your pockets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow your cash at the shop: pistol, SMG, shotgun... and trick out your ride. The more you grind, the harder you hit — and the more you run the place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Come back for more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short missions generated on a loop, instant action: the perfect game to boot up for five minutes or two hours. Climb the global leaderboard and prove who lasts longest in this crazy town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the wheel. The city is yours.</p>", "short_description": "A fun, no-nonsense top-down action game: tear through an infested low-poly city, rip through short, dynamic missions on foot or behind the wheel, and climb the global Steam leaderboard.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Danish, Spanish - Latin America, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Norwegian, Dutch, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Swedish, Czech, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Malay", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948410/cf48af341170e6fa75ab3583794fa66860d9fc0f/header.jpg?t=1785317192", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948410/fcb09cb011d27b74cebb3ec68110c786ad504a80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785317192", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948410/fcb09cb011d27b74cebb3ec68110c786ad504a80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785317192", "website": "https://kornuxindustries.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li